Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Windows Search indexer (service WSearch) disabled.
; Taskbar search then only finds apps and settings, no files or folders.
; Explorer's search box still works, but searches the folder directly (slower).
; Outlook search may be slower or find less.
; Takes effect after a restart (or: sc stop WSearch).
; Undo: set Start to 2 (automatic), restart, or as admin:
;   sc config WSearch start= delayed-auto & sc start WSearch

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\WSearch]
"Start"=dword:00000004
